  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Asif Jafar Shaikh vs State Of Maharashtra on 21 September, 2023 Author: N.J.Jamadar Bench: N.J.Jamadar 902 aba 2660 of 2023. In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.2660 Of 2023 Asif Jafar Shaikh ... Applicant versus The State of Maharashtra ... Respondent Mr. Aamir Shaikh, for Applicant. Ms. Pallavi N. Dabholkar, App for State. Coram: N.J.Jamadar, J. Date : 21 September 2023 P.C. 1. 2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R.No.168 of 2023 registered with Rabodi Police Station for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 272, 273, read with Section 34 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 26(2)(i), 27(3)(e), 26(2)(iv), 30(2)(a) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with C.R.No.168 of 2023 registered with Rabodi Police Station for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 272, 273, read with Section 34 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 26(2)(i), 27(3)(e), 26(2)(iv), 30(2)(a) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. The learned Counsel for the Applicant submits that the co-accused was found in possession of the contraband articles - Gutkha Panmasala and on the basis of the statement of the co-accused, the applicant has been roped in.",
